    "name": "Smartcar Vehicles Security API",
    "description": "The Smartcar Vehicles API provides a standardized REST interface for accessing connected vehicle data and sending commands to vehicles across multiple OEMs through a single integration. Retrieve signals such as battery level, odometer, location, fuel, engine oil life, and lock status, or issue commands like lock/unlock doors, start/stop charging, set charge limits, and set navigation destinations. Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 with user-granted permissions per vehicle.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Smartcar Support\n Email: support@smartcar.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T02:08:44.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T02:08:44.000Z",
